20:["$","p","The master’s admission guide says applicants are not required to contact a supervisor before applying. This is a degree-specific instruction: do not import a supervisor-letter rule from a doctoral or different university route. Build the academic file around the current guide, then inspect the chosen scholarship notice separately.",{"children":"The master’s admission guide says applicants are not required to contact a supervisor before applying. This is a degree-specific instruction: do not import a supervisor-letter rule from a doctoral or different university route. Build the academic file around the current guide, then inspect the chosen scholarship notice separately."}]
21:["$","p","The 2027 CAS-ANSO call gives 28 February 2027, Beijing Time, for applicants and referees. That is earlier than the general USTC master’s close. In a fictional planning record, a complete university application on 20 March could fit the general window yet miss CAS-ANSO. The earlier applicable scholarship task should control your personal preparation calendar.",{"children":"The 2027 CAS-ANSO call gives 28 February 2027, Beijing Time, for applicants and referees. That is earlier than the general USTC master’s close. In a fictional planning record, a complete university application on 20 March could fit the general window yet miss CAS-ANSO. The earlier applicable scholarship task should control your personal preparation calendar."}]
22:["$","p","Create three milestones: required academic documents ready, applicant form submitted and referee actions complete. Check all dates on the current owner pages. Where an exact closing hour is absent, do not manufacture one for a countdown. Record the full scholarship name in your application notes so that a later funding result can be matched to its own conditions.",{"children":"Create three milestones: required academic documents ready, applicant form submitted and referee actions complete. Check all dates on the current owner pages. Where an exact closing hour is absent, do not manufacture one for a countdown. Record the full scholarship name in your application notes so that a later funding result can be matched to its own conditions."}]
