29:["$","p","If supervisor contact or acceptance evidence is required or encouraged in the published route, follow that instruction. Do not assume every degree requires a professor’s letter, and do not treat an informal email as an admission or scholarship award.",{"children":"If supervisor contact or acceptance evidence is required or encouraged in the published route, follow that instruction. Do not assume every degree requires a professor’s letter, and do not treat an informal email as an admission or scholarship award."}]
2a:["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Read the current admission guide before writing your file","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/statement-of-purpose/",{"href":"/guides/statement-of-purpose/","children":["Write a focused statement of purpose",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]
2b:["$","section","4-Build an application file that can be checked",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build an application file that can be checked"}],[["$","p","Organise identity, qualifications, transcripts and the grading explanation. Add language evidence, study or research plans, references and other materials only as required by your current guide. Keep each referee’s task and deadline clear.",{"children":"Organise identity, qualifications, transcripts and the grading explanation. Add language evidence, study or research plans, references and other materials only as required by your current guide. Keep each referee’s task and deadline clear."}],["$","p","Check whether the system requests original documents, translations or a particular file format. If a degree is still in progress, verify the allowed provisional evidence and final completion date. A general expectation that you will graduate is not a substitute for the required certificate.",{"children":"Check whether the system requests original documents, translations or a particular file format. If a degree is still in progress, verify the allowed provisional evidence and final completion date. A general expectation that you will graduate is not a substitute for the required certificate."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2e",null,{"id":"guides/ustc-scholarships-admissions:section-5","title":"Check your progress","items":["Correct institution, degree and intake confirmed","Programme and teaching language checked","Funding category selected from the current guide","Academic evidence and references prepared","Supervisor-contact requirement verified rather than assumed"]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2c:["$","section","5-Cycle status and submission planning",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Cycle status and submission planning"}],[["$","p","USTC’s current international master’s guide now covers 2027 entry and gives 25 October 2026–31 March 2027 as its overall online-application window. The guide explicitly says scholarship application periods can differ; use the named award’s notice rather than treating 31 March as a universal funding deadline.",{"children":"USTC’s current international master’s guide now covers 2027 entry and gives 25 October 2026–31 March 2027 as its overall online-application window. The guide explicitly says scholarship application periods can differ; use the named award’s notice rather than treating 31 March as a universal funding deadline."}],["$","p","Where a CSC or ANSO route requires more than one record or system, check which submission completes each stage. Save the final receipt and application number from every required system, rather than assuming one portal sends everything automatically.",{"children":"Where a CSC or ANSO route requires more than one record or system, check which submission completes each stage. Save the final receipt and application number from every required system, rather than assuming one portal sends everything automatically."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2d:["$","section","6-After an offer: verify the remaining financial gap",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"After an offer: verify the remaining financial gap"}],[["$","p","Read the award letter for duration, continuation conditions and the actual benefits. Check accommodation charges, payments before the first stipend and any costs outside the package. A funding overview can be less specific than the final award.",{"children":"Read the award letter for duration, continuation conditions and the actual benefits. Check accommodation charges, payments before the first stipend and any costs outside the package. A funding overview can be less specific than the final award."}],["$","p","Then coordinate visa-support documents and arrival instructions with the university. Use the China cost guide to compare tuition, accommodation and one-off expenses without borrowing another university’s prices.",{"children":"Then coordinate visa-support documents and arrival instructions with the university. Use the China cost guide to compare tuition, accommodation and one-off expenses without borrowing another university’s prices."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for After an offer: verify the remaining financial gap","children":[["$","$L5","/scholarships/cas-anso/",{"href":"/scholarships/cas-anso/","children":["CAS-ANSO application route",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/china-tuition-fees-living-costs/",{"href":"/guides/china-tuition-fees-living-costs/","children":["China tuition and living-cost planning",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/china-student-visa-x1-x2/",{"href":"/guides/china-student-visa-x1-x2/","children":["China study visa pathway",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
